<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Pribislav of Mecklenburg</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. <a href="/years/1178">1178</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/12th-century">12th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Pribislav was the last prince of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/obotrites">Obotrites</a> and the first Lord of Mecklenburg. The son of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/niklot">Niklot</a>, who was killed fighting <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/henry-the-lion">Henry the Lion</a> in 1160, he accepted <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/christianity">Christianity</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/saxons">Saxon</a> overlordship in 1167 and received most of his father's lands back as a fief. His descendants, the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/house-of-mecklenburg">House of Mecklenburg</a>, ruled the region as lords, dukes and grand dukes until 1918.</p></div>
